  "body": "Stacked on #2027 (merge #2027 first)\n\n## What changed\n- Attached AccessKit `Button` info (enabled, toggled/selected state, label) in `painted::cell`.\n- Added `painted::menu_item` so custom-painted dropdown rows expose `Role::MenuItem` with enabled and toggled states.\n- Annotated section drop rows, machine mode drop rows, ribbon tooltips (`set_description`), and workspace tabs (`Role::Tab` with `set_selected`) in `panes.rs`.\n- Switched View `Panels`, Recent files, and Theme dropdown rows in `layout/mod.rs`, `recent_drop.rs`, and `theme_drop.rs` to `painted::menu_item`.\n- Added 6 pinning tests in `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/ribbon_accesskit.rs`.\n- Replaced geometry-computing clicks in ribbon behaviour tests (`tests.rs`, `first_setup.rs`, `layout.rs`, `machines_pane.rs`, `recent_door.rs`, `setup_picks_disarm.rs`, `theme_door.rs`) with AccessKit role-and-label lookups.\n- Left only the two pure layout/reach tests (`every_kind_has_a_home_on_every_machine` and `every_section_lives_behind_its_door_at_every_width`) on `ribbon_cells` and `mill_plan_at`.\n- Scoped 7 existing UI tests (`tests.rs`, `fixtures_page.rs`, `machine_page.rs`, `setups_declutter.rs`, `structural.rs`, `theme_door.rs`, `unsaved.rs`) to their panel, modal prompt, or non-tab role so new ribbon button nodes do not collide with same-named buttons.\n- Recorded the design choices in `docs/decisions/1988-ribbon-accesskit.md`.\n\n## Cause\nCustom-painted ribbon cells, workspace tabs, and ribbon dropdown rows used `ui.allocate_rect` or `ui.interact` without `WidgetInfo` or `AccessKitNodeBuilder` labels. Screen readers and UI tests could not find or click them by label, forcing behaviour tests to replicate ribbon layout math and click raw coordinates.\n\n## Tests\n- Pinning tests (`crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/ribbon_accesskit.rs`, all 6 red before fix on `base-2027`, green after fix):\n  - `ribbon_cells_and_tabs_expose_button_accesskit_nodes`\n  - `section_dropdown_rows_expose_menu_items`\n  - `view_dropdown_rows_expose_menu_items`\n  - `theme_dropdown_rows_expose_menu_items`\n  - `recent_dropdown_rows_expose_menu_items`\n  - `workspace_tabs_expose_button_accesskit_nodes_and_switch`\n- Mutation checks (each reverted guard failed its pin and passed again when restored):\n  - `layout/mod.rs` (`view_drop`): `view_dropdown_rows_expose_menu_items` red -> green.\n  - `recent_drop.rs` (`show`): `recent_dropdown_rows_expose_menu_items` red -> green.\n  - `theme_drop.rs` (`show`): `theme_dropdown_rows_expose_menu_items` red -> green.\n  - `panes.rs` (`ribbon`, `ribbon_tabs`): 3 `ribbon_accesskit` tests + `ribbon_drill_cell_creates_a_drill_operation` red -> green.\n  - `painted::cell`: 5 `ribbon_accesskit` tests red -> green.\n  - `painted::menu_item`: 4 `ribbon_accesskit` tests red -> green.\n- Verification on final commit `dd46bd048`:\n  - `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: passed.\n  - `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`: passed (`camcraft-ui --lib`: `835 passed; 0 failed; 6 ignored`; `boundary`: `3 passed`; `boundary_picks`: `6 passed`; `sinker_setup`: `2 passed`; `theme_files`: `14 passed`; `waterjet_tool`: `1 passed`).\n\n## Goldens moved\nNone.\n\n## Not exercised\n- The 6 pre-existing `#[ignore]` tests in `camcraft-ui --lib` (`egui_shell_snapshot`, `egui_shell_snapshot_light`, `tool_editor_snapshot`, `review_1710_wcs_page_and_viewport_evidence`, and 2 `play_bench_tests` benchmarks).\n- Workspace crates outside `gate quick`'s mapped UI suites (only `crates/ui` source/test files and `docs/decisions/1988-ribbon-accesskit.md` changed).\n\n## Overlaps\n- Stacked on `#2027` (`painted::cell`, `panes.rs`, `tests.rs`, `tests/machine_page.rs`).\n- Same function in open PRs (whichever merges second refreshes): `#2059` touches `recent_drop::show` (`RecentRow::Examples`); `#1687` touches `theme_drop::show` (adds `WidgetInfo` button labels there).\n- Same file, different functions or tests (whichever merges second refreshes): `#2029` (`layout/mod.rs`, `tests.rs`, `tests/structural.rs`), `#1798` (`panes::status`, `tests/structural.rs`), `#2061` (`tests/machines_pane.rs`), `#2068` and `#1996` (`tests.rs`, `tests/layout.rs`, `tests/structural.rs`), `#1717` (`tests/structural.rs`), `#2078`, `#2077`, `#2036`, `#2023`, `#1938`, `#1931`, `#1753`, `#1685`, `#1330`, and `#1209` (`tests.rs`).\n\nChangelog: Give painted ribbon cells, workspace tabs, and dropdown rows AccessKit nodes and switch ribbon behaviour tests to click by label.\nFixes #1988\n\n\n\n## Ribbon screenshots (review evidence)\n\nBoth shipped theme files are shown at 1280 × 720 with workspace tabs, ribbon cells, and group captions visible. Before is `cfc8447eef08cef4324d594e3f5195df02b189cc` (before #2027). After is the reviewed head `dd46bd0483452df3b521f07d7a7e9d9e9e18f784`, including #2027's ribbon height and ink changes. These are real egui shell renders of a blank document. All images are stored only on the fork's `pr-screenshots` branch. This evidence update changes no PR source files or code head.\n\n| Theme | Before | After |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Horizon Day | ![Horizon Day before, 1280 × 720](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/9a0cbde53f3698703052796e98327a51b0a6db86/2081/horizon-day-before.png) | ![Horizon Day after, 1280 × 720](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/9a0cbde53f3698703052796e98327a51b0a6db86/2081/horizon-day-after.png) |\n| Teal Night | ![Teal Night before, 1280 × 720](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/9a0cbde53f3698703052796e98327a51b0a6db86/2081/teal-night-before.png) | ![Teal Night after, 1280 × 720](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/9a0cbde53f3698703052796e98327a51b0a6db86/2081/teal-night-after.png) |\n",
